{"id":"a3970a22e73ed3ca","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-pairing-function.md","title":"Recursive Pairing Function","display":"df-pairing-function — Recursive Pairing Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-pairing-function","aliases":["68-df-pairing-function"],"display":"df-pairing-function — Recursive Pairing Function","depends_on":["[[68-df-recursive-function]]","[[68-df-number-theoretic-function]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"Local auxiliary Cantor pairing; contrast §7 pp.18-19 / PDF 27-28","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_proof_status":"local-proof-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-pairing-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-pairing-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pairing-function — Recursive Pairing Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a82d826d433dcff3\" href=\"?note=a82d826d433dcff3\" title=\"68-df-recursive-function\">68-df-recursive-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c524671590651be2\" href=\"?note=c524671590651be2\" title=\"68-df-number-theoretic-function\">68-df-number-theoretic-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Local auxiliary Cantor pairing; contrast §7 pp.18-19 / PDF 27-28"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"local-proof-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b,c,d,z\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(a,b,c,d,z\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TotalRec}\">\\(\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a82d826d433dcff3\" href=\"?note=a82d826d433dcff3\" title=\"68-df-recursive-function\">68-df-recursive-function</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a,b)\">\\((a,b)\\)</span> 是集合论有序对，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{pair}\">\\(\\mathrm{pair}\\)</span> 是下式引入的数值配对函数图。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{pair}:=\\{((a,b),\\tfrac{(a+b)(a+b+1)}2+b):a,b\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{pair}:=\\{((a,b),\\tfrac{(a+b)(a+b+1)}2+b):a,b\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{pair}\\in\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^2},\\qquad\n\\forall a,b,c,d\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\mathrm{pair}(a,b)=\\mathrm{pair}(c,d)\\Rightarrow a=c\\land b=d),\\qquad\n\\forall z\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists a,b\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\mathrm{pair}(a,b)=z).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{pair}\\in\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^2},\\qquad\n\\forall a,b,c,d\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\mathrm{pair}(a,b)=\\mathrm{pair}(c,d)\\Rightarrow a=c\\land b=d),\\qquad\n\\forall z\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists a,b\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\mathrm{pair}(a,b)=z).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是目录沿用的 Cantor 配对辅助选择；原书 §7 pp.18–19 / PDF pp.27–28 使用素数幂的有限序列编码，现另由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fee56385c180d0b9\" href=\"?note=fee56385c180d0b9\" title=\"68-df-sequence-code\">68-df-sequence-code</a> 承载，不能把本式误标为原书的编码公式。令 t_s=s(s+1)/2，区间 [t_s,t_{s+1}) 恰容纳 a+b=s 的 s+1 对，证明全性、单射及满射；逆函数由有界搜索求 s,b,a。加乘及除以固定常数的整数商为递归运算，故本函数及其逆递归。已作本地构造复核。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"a82d826d433dcff3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-recursive-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-number-theoretic-function","status":"resolved","id":"c524671590651be2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-number-theoretic-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"a82d826d433dcff3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$a,b,c,d,z\\in\\mathbb N$。$\\mathrm{TotalRec}$ 见 [[68-df-recursive-function]]。$(a,b)$ 是集合论有序对，$\\mathrm{pair}$ 是下式引入的数值配对函数图。","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-sequence-code","status":"resolved","id":"fee56385c180d0b9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"这是目录沿用的 Cantor 配对辅助选择；原书 §7 pp.18–19 / PDF pp.27–28 使用素数幂的有限序列编码，现另由 [[68-df-sequence-code]] 承载，不能把本式误标为原书的编码公式。令 t_s=s(s+1)/2，区间 [t_s,t_{s+1}) 恰容纳 a+b=s 的 s+1 对，证明全性、单射及满射；逆函数由有界搜索求 s,b,a。加乘及除以固定常数的整数商为递归运算，故本函数及其逆递归。已作本地构造复核。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"a,b,c,d,z\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TotalRec}","display":false},{"tex":"(a,b)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{pair}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{pair}:=\\{((a,b),\\tfrac{(a+b)(a+b+1)}2+b):a,b\\in\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{pair}\\in\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^2},\\qquad\n\\forall a,b,c,d\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\mathrm{pair}(a,b)=\\mathrm{pair}(c,d)\\Rightarrow a=c\\land b=d),\\qquad\n\\forall z\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists a,b\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\mathrm{pair}(a,b)=z).","display":true}],"bytes":1598,"backlinks":[{"id":"93be4ecb17896d81","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f262e3cfb0b8ba42","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\alpha\\in\\mathcal B$，$i,j\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal B^{\\mathbb N}$。$\\mathrm{pair}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N$ 是 [[68-df-pairing-function]] 已核对的递归双射。$\\mathrm{col}(\\alpha,i)$ 是一个实，$\\mathrm{join}_{\\mathcal B}(\\Gamma)$ 是编码整个实序列的实。"},{"id":"9e745949a6ee96af","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartRec}$ 与多元索引 $\\varphi_e^{(k)}$ 的对应见 [[68-thm-basic-machine-characterization]]、[[68-df-kleene-normal-form]]；$\\mathrm{pair}$ 见 [[68-df-pairing-function]]。$k\\in\\mathbb N$。"},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-pairing-function]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-59","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-pairing-function]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-106","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-pairing-function|df-pairing-function — Recursive Pairing Function]]"}],"outgoing":["a82d826d433dcff3","c524671590651be2","fee56385c180d0b9"]}